// Title: Mavinject Inject DLL Into Running Process
// Sigma ID: 4f73421b-5a0b-4bbf-a892-5a7fb99bea66
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: frack113, Florian Roth
// Date: 2021-07-12 | Modified: 2022-12-05
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, stealth, T1055.001, T1218.013
// Description: Detects process injection using the signed Windows tool "Mavinject" via the "INJECTRUNNING" flag
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1218/T1218.md
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1056.004/T1056.004.md
//   - https://posts.specterops.io/mavinject-exe-functionality-deconstructed-c29ab2cf5c0e
//   - https://twitter.com/gN3mes1s/status/941315826107510784
//   - https://reaqta.com/2017/12/mavinject-microsoft-injector/
//   - https://twitter.com/Hexacorn/status/776122138063409152
//   - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/issues/3742
//   - https://github.com/keyboardcrunch/SentinelOne-ATTACK-Queries/blob/6a228d23eefe963ca81f2d52f94b815f61ef5ee0/Tactics/DefenseEvasion.md#t1055-process-injection
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_mavinject_process_injection.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains " /INJECTRUNNING " and (not(InitiatingProcessFolderPath =~ "C:\\Windows\\System32\\AppVClient.exe"))
